Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.90,0:00:04.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})还能确认到信号。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.35,0:00:07.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没问题吧。{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.24,0:00:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅴ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})现在只能相信了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.58,0:00:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信他会把那个唯一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:13.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被那家伙称为朋友的男人带回来。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.40,0:00:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.14,0:00:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)来吧 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.55,0:00:19.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我马上让你在地狱和同伴们见面！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.41,0:00:28.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咳… 你这家伙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.12,0:00:32.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}该下地狱的是你！纳修！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.22,0:00:37.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你让我真正发火这件事我会让你后悔的！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.06,0:00:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《没错 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}。更加 憎恨我吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.07,0:00:46.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过埋葬这样的你我将成为真正的巴利安》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.11,0:00:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.02,0:00:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.73,0:01:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的运气还没用完呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.66,0:01:07.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.79,0:01:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}三角戏法盒！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.46,0:01:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己墓地里的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.46,0:01:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}3只怪兽超量除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.14,0:01:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将新怪兽超量的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.05,0:01:18.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.35,0:01:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.42,0:01:23.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将墓地里的 戏法人偶 巨人杀手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.52,0:01:26.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连环杀手 天堂之弦除外。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.66,0:01:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！ No.88！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:36.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戏法人偶 命运之狮！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.04,0:01:40.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}命运之狮。确实 那只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.91,0:01:42.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过自身效果 当超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.97,0:01:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部消失的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.68,0:01:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是能直接赢得决斗的强力怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.10,0:01:50.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 现在那个效果用不了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.70,0:01:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说白了 你的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.92,0:01:55.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就跟被拔了牙的狮子一样！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.91,0:01:58.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。所以我要用这家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.28,0:02:02.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阶级提升魔法 银色·混沌·之力\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.95,0:02:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第三次阶级提升!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.89,0:02:10.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.20,0:02:13.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用阶级８的命运·狮子进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.49,0:02:14.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以１只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.76,0:02:17.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.50,0:02:19.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.61,0:02:22.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！CNo.88！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.82,0:02:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咆哮吧 狂野的灵魂。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.45,0:02:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将毁灭一切的 愤怒唤醒吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.10,0:02:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机关傀儡 灾难·狮子！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.90,0:02:38.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔) CNo.88？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.66,0:02:41.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙… 连命运·狮子都
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.92,0:02:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给混沌化了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.22,0:04:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这才是我的最强也是最后的王牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.42,0:04:21.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是灾难雷奥！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.01,0:04:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}忘了吗 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.89,0:04:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管是什么样的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.59,0:04:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要暗黑骑士有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.52,0:04:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量单元存在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.71,0:04:29.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就是不死之身！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.47,0:04:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实就算把你的怪兽破坏掉{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.70,0:04:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也会再次复活 并且按其攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.26,0:04:38.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的生命值会回复。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.78,0:04:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 这次会怎样呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.71,0:04:43.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动灾难雷奥的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.26,0:04:45.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.23,0:04:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.91,0:04:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给对手玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.20,0:04:51.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}造成4000点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.91,0:04:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.43,0:04:55.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}极限加算！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.04,0:05:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害的效果。要是纳修
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.87,0:05:07.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有增加生命值的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.90,0:05:09.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一击就沉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.88,0:05:13.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…原来如此…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.10,0:05:14.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然是强力的怪兽，不过{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.38,0:05:17.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的生命值还留着呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.17,0:05:21.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，就在这一瞬间我的胜利已经确定了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.20,0:05:22.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.66,0:05:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.20,0:05:28.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}灾难·雷奥继承了命运·雷奥的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.28,0:05:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.40,0:05:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔，特殊胜利条件？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.10,0:05:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.39,0:05:35.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有超量单位的灾难·雷奥{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.93,0:05:37.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在迎来回合结束时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.77,0:05:40.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就赢得决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.70,0:05:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}灾难·雷奥的超量单位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.56,0:05:44.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经是零了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.01,0:05:47.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不进行战斗就这样回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.94,0:05:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.98,0:05:53.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})纳修。这下你就完蛋了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.23,0:05:56.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最终一击！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.61,0:06:07.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干掉了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.95,0:06:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纳修… 这下 这下终于把你…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.71,0:06:12.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)还没完…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.83,0:06:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.96,0:06:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胜负还没分出来呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.97,0:06:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能… 为什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.12,0:06:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你好好看看你的怪兽吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.72,0:06:24.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什… 什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.09,0:06:25.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.69,0:06:28.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}灾厄雄狮身上竟然有超量单元!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.11,0:06:30.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动了永续陷阱{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.25,0:06:33.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量奖励的效果啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.40,0:06:35.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.53,0:06:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己场上存在的怪兽超量素材的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.36,0:06:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量单元一个{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.65,0:06:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对手的怪兽EX。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.80,0:06:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 灾难·雷奥的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.94,0:06:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.19,0:06:49.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 但是 纳修。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.59,0:06:50.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}灾难·雷奥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.60,0:06:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不受怪兽效果影响。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.52,0:06:54.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 就算到了你的回合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.85,0:06:57.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也无法用暗黑骑士的效果来吸收。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.37,0:07:00.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有混沌超量单位的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.44,0:07:02.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗黑骑士 并非不死之身。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.13,0:07:06.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在我下一个回合就给你致命一击！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.05,0:07:08.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe} 谢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.27,0:07:11.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的憎恨正把我逼入绝境。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.50,0:07:15.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}逼向无法回头的 地狱深渊…》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.44,0:07:19.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.01,0:07:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的命运 还没有…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.48,0:07:25.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.98,0:07:28.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动命运十字抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.89,0:07:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是 双方
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.22,0:07:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}各抽1张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.35,0:07:34.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 如果抽到的是怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.20,0:07:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在对方场上以表侧守备表示特殊召唤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.86,0:07:41.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并回复那个攻击力数值的生命值！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.11,0:07:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《要是这里抽不到怪兽我就输了…》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.78,0:07:48.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这才是真正的命运抽卡》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.51,0:07:50.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.56,0:07:52.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.01,0:07:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.02,0:07:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.77,0:08:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你抽到的好像不是怪兽啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.44,0:08:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我抽到的是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.57,0:08:16.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}命运…对我说了要战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.71,0:08:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.40,0:08:20.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看好了 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.45,0:08:22.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡才是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.85,0:08:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为真正的屏障活下去的命运的一枚！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.20,0:08:29.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我为了向人心宣告诀别的一枚。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.30,0:08:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}向人心……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.19,0:08:34.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((远东的 老千冠军……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.13,0:08:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己的同伴 一个接一个被打倒的样子……))
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.94,0:08:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你…… 难道说！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.29,0:08:42.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 抽到的是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.16,0:08:45.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽卡 沉默·沃比！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.55,0:08:48.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因命运之交叉抽卡的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.86,0:08:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将沉默·沃比
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.19,0:08:52.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤到你的场上。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.79,0:08:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 我的生命值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.25,0:08:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}按那家伙的攻击力回复！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.84,0:09:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 暗黑骑士的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.91,0:09:05.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合 一次将对手1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.81,0:09:06.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成暗黑骑士的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.67,0:09:08.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量单元！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.88,0:09:10.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗黑灵魂掠夺者！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.07,0:09:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.34,0:09:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗黑骑士身上有混沌超量单元！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.15,0:09:22.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将暗黑骑士改为攻击表示！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.53,0:09:25.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，暗黑骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.90,0:09:28.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击灾难雷奥！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.82,0:09:42.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.11,0:09:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要混沌超量单元还在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.10,0:09:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗黑骑士即使被破坏也会复活！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.72,0:09:49.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}归来吧，从轮回中！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.04,0:09:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，按照暗黑骑士的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.41,0:09:56.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的生命值会回复！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.80,0:10:05.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然自己让怪兽自爆来回复生命值！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.52,0:10:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完。我从手牌发动速攻魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.51,0:10:11.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力量之流！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.15,0:10:14.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在战斗特殊召唤的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.35,0:10:15.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水属性怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.86,0:10:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量单元！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.55,0:10:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得不错嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.36,0:10:21.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 只要你的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.82,0:10:23.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有超量奖励{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.19,0:10:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能再次将灾难狮子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.60,0:10:27.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的超量单元送过去{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.33,0:10:30.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的特殊胜利条件就会被阻止了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.26,0:10:33.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 通过命运交叉抽卡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.49,0:10:34.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也抽到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.50,0:10:38.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将束缚你的命运彻底击溃的卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.17,0:10:41.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动 速攻魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.13,0:10:43.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}诡计复仇！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.71,0:10:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.54,0:10:46.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽超量以外的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.30,0:10:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使对方1只怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.10,0:10:51.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的超量单元增减时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.54,0:10:52.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.72,0:10:53.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.87,0:10:56.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方的回合从手牌发动速攻魔法？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.68,0:10:59.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 机关复仇者将{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.31,0:11:01.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.11,0:11:03.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只机关傀儡怪兽的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.25,0:11:04.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力数值的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.58,0:11:05.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.39,0:11:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}灾难狮子的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.57,0:11:11.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}3500的伤害 接招吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.66,0:11:15.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回来吧 凌牙！！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.23,0:11:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.97,0:11:32.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还差一步了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.74,0:11:33.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下个回合
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.02,0:11:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.13,0:11:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)没用的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.37,0:11:40.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不会再有下个回合了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.09,0:11:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.62,0:11:45.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗中特殊召唤的暗黑骑士还有{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.55,0:11:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击次数剩下。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.24,0:11:51.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事我早就知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.67,0:11:54.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 暗黑骑士{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.11,0:11:56.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是打不倒我的 灾厄狮子！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.06,0:11:58.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可不好说？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.86,0:12:02.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}速攻魔法 力量之流。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.91,0:12:04.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将它叠放于
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.52,0:12:06.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽时 在战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.57,0:12:08.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力上升1000点。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.18,0:12:12.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会…攻击力3800！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.81,0:12:15.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗 命运的交叉抽卡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.47,0:12:17.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个时候 就已经…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.24,0:12:20.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再见了 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.89,0:12:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗黑骑士 攻击 灾厄狮子！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.76,0:12:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《是啊…我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.70,0:12:52.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一直都知道》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.48,0:13:10.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.91,0:13:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧…真是个让人不爽的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.77,0:13:18.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了让自己被逼入无法回头的命运{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.93,0:13:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然利用我。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.41,0:13:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你察觉到了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.79,0:13:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但 结果 我还是没能改变你的命运。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.21,0:13:33.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你接下来要和游马他们战斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.62,0:13:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊。 那就是 我的命运。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.24,0:13:38.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然 还是变成这样了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.85,0:13:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的 命运这玩意儿…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.20,0:13:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 最后能和你交手真是太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.21,0:13:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我先走一步在地狱等着你。 凌牙…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.12,0:13:54.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.19,0:13:56.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.49,0:14:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唯独你们 我绝不会伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.89,0:14:02.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等这场战斗结束之后…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.89,0:14:06.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也会立刻追随而去》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.92,0:14:13.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)啊 醒了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.39,0:14:16.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟 这里是……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.94,0:14:18.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)游马……你醒过来了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.52,0:14:20.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我到底……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.62,0:14:22.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光体)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.61,0:14:24.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里是V开的车里。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.42,0:14:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你因为连战的疲惫{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.33,0:14:30.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}七皇出现的时候昏过去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.55,0:14:34.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了 那时候鲨鱼的意识
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.27,0:14:36.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}涌进了我体内……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.50,0:14:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 七皇呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.69,0:14:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家都平安无事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.94,0:14:44.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦……铁男呢？还有{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.55,0:14:48.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那两个人为了让我们逃走留下来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.46,0:14:50.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.40,0:14:52.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是怎么回事啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.48,0:14:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.86,0:14:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥大人！{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥的信号！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.23,0:15:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂……喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.15,0:15:11.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的信号消失了到底……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.03,0:15:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)这样一来 拥有 No.卡的人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.88,0:15:27.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马和星光 还有快斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅴ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe} {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.67,0:15:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.74,0:15:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算把草根一根根分开也要找出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.11,0:15:35.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做个了断吧 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.92,0:15:41.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纳修的力量 果然可不能小看啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.69,0:15:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是那些家伙团结一致就算是我……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.19,0:15:50.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 那就开始搞点什么不好的阴谋吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.20,0:15:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会……骗人的吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.64,0:15:58.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不只是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连铁男和大家都是。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.17,0:16:01.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.35,0:16:04.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事 怎么可能有啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.77,0:16:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！都怪我。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.25,0:16:10.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都怪我，大家才……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.38,0:16:12.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家才！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.67,0:16:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对，不是游马的错……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.46,0:16:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海斗)不。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.41,0:16:19.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海斗)是我们的错！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.28,0:16:20.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.56,0:16:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}事到如今还掩盖事实有什么用。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.33,0:16:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}痛苦的又不是只有你一个人！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.23,0:16:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}ⅤⅢ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.54,0:16:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说得没错，游马
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.67,0:16:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要是 here 在这里软弱下去的话，{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.27,0:16:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，托马斯还有大家都白白送死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.15,0:16:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是，为什么鲨鱼会突然变成我们的敌人？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.98,0:16:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不知道。但他是巴利安。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.09,0:16:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一战无法避免。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.69,0:16:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算那家伙是巴利安我们是同伴啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.39,0:16:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可即便如此你还是要我去战斗吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.94,0:16:55.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯特)那家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.71,0:16:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙 曾是同伴连{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都被他打倒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.60,0:17:01.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他是认真的这件事你难道不明白吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.68,0:17:06.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算凯特·鲨鱼的心情是认真的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.32,0:17:08.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙果然还是同伴啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.27,0:17:11.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 虽然我说不太好{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.98,0:17:14.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但互相理解的心意是不能放弃的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.48,0:17:16.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要不放弃这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.71,0:17:18.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总有一天 一定能找到别的路。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.05,0:17:23.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}避开与鲨鱼他们战斗的另一条路！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.10,0:17:25.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《避开战斗的路…》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.39,0:17:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 但是 要怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.05,0:17:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 那个嘛…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.20,0:17:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}或许有。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.60,0:17:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不与巴利安七皇战斗的道路 那就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.60,0:17:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接干掉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.49,0:17:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上千主上。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.68,0:17:42.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上千主上？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.29,0:17:44.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西）那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.36,0:17:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上千主上 那是巴利安的神。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.54,0:17:52.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他的力量在遥远的过去被封印了… 但是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.33,0:17:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从这地上的状况来看{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.27,0:17:58.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那股力量似乎已经复苏了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.24,0:18:01.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕是上千主上操控了七皇{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.37,0:18:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让自己的力量复活了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.46,0:18:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 上千主上才是幕后黑手！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.24,0:18:09.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要打倒那家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.14,0:18:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与七皇的战斗就有可能回避。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.10,0:18:15.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！ 上千主上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.94,0:18:17.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是在巴利安世界吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.93,0:18:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我们也……。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.35,0:18:20.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉，我去不了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.71,0:18:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？为、为什么啊？快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.74,0:18:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}走了， orbital。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.32,0:18:26.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵、遵命。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.38,0:18:29.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我有非做不可的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.48,0:18:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会……。非做
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.52,0:18:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可的事，到底是什么……。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.05,0:18:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.11,0:18:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，你倒是说句话啊，快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.47,0:18:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.31,0:18:44.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.57,0:18:48.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们也不能和你一起走。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.95,0:18:52.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要回去和七皇做个了断。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.27,0:18:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎……怎么回事啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.46,0:18:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}亲人被打倒的我们的愤怒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.55,0:18:59.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你终究是不会明白的。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.21,0:19:02.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会……。复仇的空虚{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.34,0:19:03.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们才是最
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.53,0:19:04.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}清楚的吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.46,0:19:07.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没搞明白的是你才对！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.77,0:19:08.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.38,0:19:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥的仇，我一定要亲手报。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.83,0:19:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才不会像你那样没出息！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.02,0:19:20.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，跟你说话真让人烦。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.31,0:19:25.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不服气的话就证明你自己的做法啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.85,0:19:36.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么他们突然……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.84,0:19:38.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不知道。但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.81,0:19:40.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}尽是带着这种仇恨来决斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.35,0:19:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定要把这种事改变掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.20,0:19:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好了，走吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.48,0:19:50.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来只有我和游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.12,0:19:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟她们回家去。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.40,0:19:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.34,0:19:58.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿！大家帮我跟奶奶她们带个话。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.74,0:20:01.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就说我不用担心的。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.82,0:20:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个…游马 我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.23,0:20:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事的啦 小鸟！我一定会…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.32,0:20:10.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在喵什么啊 小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.89,0:20:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？ 哎哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.21,0:20:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要跟去的吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.66,0:20:14.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.70,0:20:19.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）啊… 什、什么啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.28,0:20:21.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟！游马就交给你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.05,0:20:23.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对不可以离开他哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.70,0:20:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是离开了我真的会把你吃掉的哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.82,0:20:29.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小猫…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.86,0:20:31.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.45,0:20:39.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）说到底为什么要做那种事？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.41,0:20:41.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.24,0:20:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也想一起去。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.19,0:20:45.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 已经
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.17,0:20:47.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我能为你做的事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.42,0:20:48.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么都没有了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.28,0:20:53.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(V)小鸟为我准备的 这个是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.33,0:20:58.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叫做寿司的东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.16,0:21:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是的哦。这是决斗饭。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.25,0:21:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊。味道不错嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.30,0:21:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe} 抱歉。和游马的离别 竟然变成那样…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.14,0:21:12.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这也是没办法的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.07,0:21:15.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安的追兵已经逼近了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.27,0:21:20.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是知道这件事游马一定会说要战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.65,0:21:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但如今 游马他们找到了新的希望。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.99,0:21:26.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.76,0:21:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能终结这一切的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.65,0:21:29.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有他们。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.69,0:21:33.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在他们平安启程之前把那些家伙引开。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.63,0:21:39.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}兄长也相信着游马呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.52,0:21:42.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我押上了全部。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.68,0:21:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}押在游马那份相信他人的力量上。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.96,0:21:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)你们这些家伙…游马和快斗在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.42,0:21:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想知道的话就先打倒我们吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.75,0:21:57.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要当我的新塔奇翁的对手吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.17,0:21:59.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不试试看怎么知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.18,0:22:04.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 要是现在逃了会被托马斯兄长笑话的。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.84,0:22:07.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(V)说得没错。托马斯在地狱等着呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.89,0:23:44.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.71,0:23:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.26,0:23:49.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.02,0:23:51.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.26,0:23:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.44,0:23:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.07,0:23:58.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.88,0:24:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.88,0:24:03.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.11,0:24:07.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
